# k6 target API — a trivial hello/signin app whose only purpose is to be
# load-tested by Grafana k6 (test/k6/load-test.spec.ts). Run `pnpm start:k6`
# first, then send these. Both routes are the k6 load-test targets.

### 1. GET / — tagged `endpoint: hello` in the k6 script
GET http://localhost:3000

### 2. POST /signin — tagged `endpoint: users` in the k6 script.
###    No ValidationPipe here, so any body is accepted; echoes it back (200).
POST http://localhost:3000/signin
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "johndoe",
  "password": "password123"
}